    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1190a-a5">

                <pb facs="1267" n="1171" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1171"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-22"><hi rendition="#italic">April 22,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>By proclamation to-day, under resolution of Congress approved 20th, President
                    announces blockade of ports on north side of Cuba between Cardenas and Bahia
                    Honda; also Cienfuegos, south side. Notify minister for foreign affairs.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>(To all United States legations abroad.)</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
